    "lore": "Gnaw, rebuilt out of three squares in the mod maker. He has no template: every move is his own data, and his gimmick script does what Gnaw's move scripts do.",
    "mechanics": "Gnaw uses a range of slashes and fire attacks to keep his opponents away from the stage.",
    "combo": [
      {
        "name": "Fireball",
        "description": "Spit out a big fireball that flies in an arc, depending on where you're aiming it. Can light the ground on fire, too!"
      },
      {
        "name": "Big Bite",
        "description": "Take a big chomp that knocks opponents far away and heals you on hit."
      },
      {
        "name": "Fire Barrage!",
        "description": "Fire out 7 big Fireballs in front of you at once, scorching everything in your path! "
      }
    ]
  },
